```typescript
const handleNewConversation = useCallback(() => {
  const outgoingId = conversation.activeConversationId;
  conversation.startNewConversation();
  clearMessages(outgoingId);
}, [conversation, clearMessages]);
```

This:
1. Saves the current conversation ID as "outgoing"
2. Calls `startNewConversation()` to clear the active conversation ID
3. Calls `clearMessages()` to reset the UI state

### ConversationContext Reset
**File:** `/Users/cyyeh/Desktop/duckdb-data-agent/.claude/worktrees/implement-memory/frontend/src/contexts/ConversationContext.tsx` (lines 79-81)

```typescript
